		{
			"ref_slug": "gc-how-it-works",
			"title": "How this program works",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How this program works</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Six weeks, the same small group all the way through. Everyone starts together and finishes together, and that's the bit that makes it work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What a week looks like</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The call</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Ninety minutes, same time every week</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The recording</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Posted the following day</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Between calls</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">One worksheet, and one thing you've committed to</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The group</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Open all week for questions and progress</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we ask of you</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Turn up, do the thing you said you'd do, and say it out loud on the call. Saying it in front of other people is most of why this works.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:pullquote -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>We keep the groups small on purpose. Everyone gets airtime, and nobody can quietly disappear.</p></blockquote></figure>\n<!-- /wp:pullquote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">If you miss a call</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Watch the recording and post your commitment in the group before the next one. Missing one happens and it's fine. Just don't go quiet for a fortnight.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rewrite the table to match your program. Six weeks and ninety minute calls are the most common shape, but fortnightly calls or a twelve week run work the same way. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "gc-how-it-works",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "gc-before-first-call",
			"title": "Before the first call",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before the first call</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Two small things before we start. Neither takes long, and both make the first call a lot more useful.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Answer these three questions</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What do you want to be different by the end of the six weeks?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What have you already tried, and what happened?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What's most likely to get in the way?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Short answers are fine. Nobody sees these but me.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-wide\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Get yourself set up</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Put the call in your calendar as a repeating event</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Join the group space so you can post between calls</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Find somewhere to keep notes, paper or otherwise</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Build the three questions in your own form tool and paste the embed code or shortcode here. They're written out so you can rebuild them in whatever you already use. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "gc-before-first-call",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "gc-week-1",
			"title": "Week 1: Getting clear",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Week 1: Getting clear</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Session recording</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">The video for this week goes here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key takeaways</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The goal you arrive with is often one you've inherited from somebody else. Worth checking whose it actually is.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>One sentence forces a decision. If it takes a paragraph, there's more than one goal in there.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Vague goals feel safer because they can't be failed. That's exactly why they don't move.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Saying it out loud to the group is the part that makes it real.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before next week</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Write your outcome in one sentence, no hedging</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Post it in the group before Thursday</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Read it out on the next call</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resources mentioned</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Week 1 worksheet</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The one-sentence goal, written up</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note: the shape of a week page</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Replace the grey box with your video embed, then fill in the takeaways, the actions and anything you pointed people at on the call. Duplicate this page for each week.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Weeks that haven't happened yet are set to Inactive on the portal home, so they show greyed out and can't be opened. Switch one to Active when you get there. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-yellow\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-yellow\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">⚡️ Quick tip</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Turn comments on for these pages and the week's discussion stays attached to the week, rather than scrolling away in a chat app. People answer each other between calls, and by week six you've got a searchable record of what the group actually struggled with. <a href=\"https://client-portal.io/support/enable-comments-in-your-portals-y8q7z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to enable comments in your portals</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "gc-week-1",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "gc-week-2",
			"title": "Week 2: Making it real",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Week 2: Making it real</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Session recording</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">The video for this week goes here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key takeaways</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A goal with no next action is a wish, and wishes don't survive a busy fortnight.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Three things, not ten. Anything past three is next month's problem.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you can't put a date on it, it isn't specific enough yet.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The first action should be small enough to do badly and still count.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before next week</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Break your outcome into the three things that have to happen first</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Put a date against each one</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Do the first before the next call</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resources mentioned</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Week 2 worksheet</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Planning template</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->",
			"post_name": "gc-week-2",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "gc-week-3",
			"title": "Week 3: When it gets hard",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Week 3: When it gets hard</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Session recording</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">The video for this week goes here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key takeaways</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The novelty runs out around week three for almost everybody. Nothing has gone wrong.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What stops you is rarely what you'd have guessed in advance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Two or three situations usually account for nearly all the avoidance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noticing the pattern does more than trying harder against it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before next week</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Note the moments you avoid the work this week</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Bring one pattern to the call</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pick one small change that interrupts it</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resources mentioned</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Week 3 worksheet</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Avoidance tracker</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->",
			"post_name": "gc-week-3",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "gc-recommended-tools",
			"title": "Recommended tools",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recommended tools</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing here is required, and none of it is exciting. It's what people on past cohorts ended up using and stuck with.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Keeping notes</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Somewhere to think on paper between calls. Any of these do the job; the one you'll actually open is the right one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the options</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tracking the work</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A place to see whether you did the thing, without turning it into a second job. A paper list on the fridge counts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the options</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Protecting the time</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most people don't need a new app, they need the hour blocked out before anything else gets to it. These help with that.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the options</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Swap these three for whatever you actually recommend, and point the links at your own write-ups or straight at the tools. Three columns fit comfortably; a fourth starts to squeeze on a phone. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "gc-recommended-tools",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "gc-common-questions",
			"title": "Common questions",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Common questions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The things people ask most in the first couple of weeks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion -->\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion\"><!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What if I miss a call?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Watch the recording and post your commitment in the group before the next one. Recordings go up the day after each call.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Are the calls recorded?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every one. If you'd rather not be on the recording, keep your camera off and use the chat.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I ask questions between calls?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That's what the group space is for. Ask there rather than saving it up, and you'll often get an answer from someone else in the group before I get to it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What if I fall behind?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come to the call anyway. Falling behind is normal. Falling behind and then hiding is what ends programs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Is what I share confidential?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes. What's said on a call stays with the group, and we ask everyone to hold to that.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What happens at the end?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You keep the recordings and the worksheets. If you want to carry on, there are a couple of options in Resources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not covered here? Ask in the group and someone will pick it up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Swap these for the questions your cohorts actually ask. Keep something like the confidentiality answer, which matters more in group work than one to one. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "gc-common-questions",
			"meta": []
		}
	],
